# Page Layout Standards

## Page Padding

All page/detail wrapper elements must use `tokens.$page-padding` (24px) for their padding.

```scss
@use '@/styles/tokens.scss' as tokens;

.page-wrapper {
  padding: tokens.$page-padding;
}
```

The token is defined in `src/styles/tokens.scss` as `$page-padding: 24px`.

## When Creating New Pages

1. Add a wrapper div with a descriptive class (e.g. `my-feature-page-wrapper`)
2. Apply `padding: tokens.$page-padding` to that wrapper
3. Do not use `tokens.$space-md` (16px) for page-level padding
